  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$2 x+2 y y^{\\prime}-2 a y^{\\prime}=0$\n$a=\\frac{x+y y^{\\prime}}{y^{\\prime}} \\quad$ (eliminating a)\n$\\Rightarrow\\left(x^2-y^2\\right) y^{\\prime}=2 x y$",
